    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "=define",
        "text": "=You are an expert research analyst.\n\nAnalyze the research below:\n{{ $json.researchDocument }}\n\nReturn your answer using exactly this format:\n# Executive Summary\n# Key Insights\n# Important Statistics\n# Trends\n# Risks\n# Opportunities\n# Final Conclusion\n### OUTPUT FORMATTING RULES:\n1. Use markdown bullet points (`- `) for all key takeaways and item lists.\n2. Make every subtopic heading bold using double asterisks (e.g., **Subtopic Heading**).\n3. Insert two empty lines (`\\n\\n`) between distinct subtopics/sections for clear separation.\n4. Keep paragraph line spacing tight and concise.",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
